# Build output
bin/
obj/
Library/
*.zip

# Development record. Never publish: a visible AI-session log in a repo linked from a mod
# listing reads as "not to standard" to reviewers. See docs/LESSONS.md's own header.
docs/LESSONS.md

# Development workbench: notes, player feedback, backups, logs. Never published.
_dev/

# Source art: the exported PNG is versioned, the layered original is not
Pic/*.psd

# Design screenshots are for reviewing submissions, not for the mod or the repository: a few MB
# each, and git keeps every one forever. Only design.json ships.
SeenBetterDays/ShippedDesigns/**/*.png
SeenBetterDays/ShippedDesigns/**/*.jpg
